Design for Individual Upcycling seeks to facilitate the reuse of the product, components or materials once they are considered obsolete by the user.  This strategy belongs to the maintenance objective (X1) because of products remain with the same user but with renewed purpose and scope, so product life is extended.  

Some key actions for designers to facilitate individual upcycling are: 
• Create web platforms for stimulating individual upcycling;
• Engage with the individual through web sites or social networks to stimulate ideas and action.